 ;; --- 年末調整, 所得税法 第百九十条 (2026-08-18) -----------------------------
 ;;
 ;; taxlaw had read the article and NOTHING in this workspace called it. The
 ;; risk in acting on it is not that a run gets wrongly refused — the
 ;; assessment moves no money — but that the actor produces a NUMBER. The
 ;; year's correct tax comes from 別表 (税額表), which taxlaw records as
 ;; unread, so a figure here would arrive stamped with an article of the
 ;; Income Tax Act and nothing downstream could check it. Most of what
 ;; follows breaks a refusal and expects a test to notice.

 {:id :the-over-under-is-never-computed
  :invariant "第百九十条's over/under is not computable from anything read here"
